graph TB
    subgraph "llm-d Framework"
        subgraph "Routing Layer"
            Envoy["Envoy Sidecar Proxy<br/>8081/TCP"]
            EPP["Endpoint Picker Plugin (EPP)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC"]
            Envoy -->|ext_proc gRPC<br/>9002| EPP
        end

        subgraph "Model Serving Layer"
            DecodeDeploy["Decode Deployment<br/>vllm API Server<br/>8000/TCP"]
            PrefillDeploy["Prefill Deployment<br/>vllm API Server<br/>8000/TCP"]
            RoutingSidecar["Routing Sidecar<br/>--kv-connector=nixlv2"]
        end

        subgraph "KV-Cache Transfer"
            NixlPort["nixl RDMA<br/>5600/TCP"]
        end
    end

    Client[Client] -->|HTTP<br/>8081| Envoy
    EPP -->|x-gateway-destination-endpoint<br/>ORIGINAL_DST| DecodeDeploy
    EPP -->|x-gateway-destination-endpoint<br/>ORIGINAL_DST| PrefillDeploy

    PrefillDeploy -->|nixl KV-cache<br/>RDMA 5600| NixlPort
    NixlPort -->|KV-cache transfer| RoutingSidecar
    RoutingSidecar -->|intercepts 8000| DecodeDeploy

    InferencePool["Gateway API<br/>InferencePool CR"] -.->|pool membership| EPP

    subgraph "Observability"
        OTelCollector["OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC"]
        Jaeger["Jaeger<br/>4317/TCP"]
        Prometheus["Prometheus<br/>PodMonitor"]
    end

    DecodeDeploy -->|OTLP traces| OTelCollector
    PrefillDeploy -->|OTLP traces| OTelCollector
    EPP -->|OTLP traces| OTelCollector
    OTelCollector -->|forward| Jaeger
    Prometheus -.->|scrape metrics| DecodeDeploy
    Prometheus -.->|scrape metrics| PrefillDeploy

    style Envoy fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style EPP fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style DecodeDeploy fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style PrefillDeploy fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style RoutingSidecar fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style NixlPort fill:#e8544e,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style InferencePool fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Client fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style OTelCollector fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Jaeger fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Prometheus fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
